_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","review_id":"dlUBDdnOI_X1swu9PoWlSg","date":"2018-04-29T19:48:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.942224383354187,"text_excerpt":"Stumbled upon this spot per the recommendation of a friend and truly enjoyed myself. It's located in an area with lots of venues for live music are situated. When we got here on a Sunday night , it wasn't crowded at all , but the music was really good. The drinks were also ok, standard bar selections. There are two bars (one in the front and one near the back patio). So the front of the club has the stage where artists come and give you their best. At some point during the performances, one of the band members will come around with what I call a \"offering plate\" for you to make donations , because that is how they get paid! You don't pay anything to get in and hear great music, so the lea..."},{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","review_id":"gZiaYz39T6VzT4Nu6dDQWQ","date":"2014-07-17T20:26:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9305235743522644,"text_excerpt":"I loved this place on my first trip to New Orleans. It's a small lounge on Frenchmen Street so you are able to get away from the Bourbon Street crowds. When my husband and I went during our honeymoon, they had an amazing six-piece band, dysFUNKtional bone, that we could have listened to all night. Service was good. Not a lot of places to sit in the main downstairs portion but they do have a patio bar (I didn't see it). A great place to sit and listen to good music."},{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","review_id":"gEAt_RqPjXL5wW09LSXOWQ","date":"2016-11-02T05:10:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.920187771320343,"text_excerpt":"Cool spot for music lovers that like to drink. They were out of ingredients for the first two attempts at picking out cocktails but what we for instead made up for it. No cover and fair drink pricing makes it a standout in an area where every spot is doing the same thing (and charging to get in). Didn't get to try the food but it looked good. The outside patio area is a nice escape from the loudness of the band. Definitely recommended."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","photo_id":"TMImu9EFBcP2YF4m8U_yxw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/TMImu9EFBcP2YF4m8U_yxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9342045783996582},{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","photo_id":"LjsgqMBvyjEpLAGN81IMvw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LjsgqMBvyjEpLAGN81IMvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8630337715148926},{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","photo_id":"FqNo-VU9bejQQB-N3maPkg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FqNo-VU9bejQQB-N3maPkg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8269713521003723},{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","photo_id":"1gPW7VoZMRv45aFCP-CD9g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1gPW7VoZMRv45aFCP-CD9g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8044753074645996},{"business_id":"7pKzyzCFC7LpX82sM-0aMg","photo_id":"BoqWrwYiO4Lh68Oiq3Rr8w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BoqWrwYiO4Lh68Oiq3Rr8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8022173643112183}]},"notebook_case":null}
